cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  psychscanner-primal is a slim, Hub-optimized distribution of psychscanner.
  If you use it in your research, please cite the framework paper below (and
  the Reality Monitoring paper too, since that task is bundled here). The
  full reference list lives in the upstream psychscanner repository.
